.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16270&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:16270:2","headword":"끌어당기다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"마음이나 관심 등을 갖게 하다.","englishExpression":"draw; attract","englishDescription":"To make something/someone gain attention, interest, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16270&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:16270:3","headword":"끌어당기다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"보게 하다.","englishExpression":"draw; attract","englishDescription":"To make something/someone see something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16270&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:17971:2","headword":"이끌다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"다른 사람의 관심이나 시선 등을 한곳으로 집중시키다.","englishExpression":"attract; draw","englishDescription":"To make others' attention or eyes concentrated on something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=17971&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:26962:2","headword":"뽑다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"속에 있는 기체나 액체를 밖으로 나오게 하다.","englishExpression":"draw; extract","englishDescription":"To make liquid inside something come outside.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=26962&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:28128:1","headword":"치다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"커튼, 가리개, 장막 등을 써서 둘레를 두르거나 늘어뜨리다.","englishExpression":"draw","englishDescription":"To surround something with a curtain, screen, tent, etc.,","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28128&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:37219:1","headword":"긋다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"금이나 줄을 그리다.","englishExpression":"draw","englishDescription":"To draw a line or stroke.","sourceUrl":"h