ion, etc., about something.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=46644&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:48623:1","headword":"동원하다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"어떤 목적을 이루려고 사람이나 물건, 방법 등을 한데 모으다.","englishExpression":"draw; gather","englishDescription":"To gather people, goods, methods, etc., in one place to achieve a purpose.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=48623&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:57277:1","headword":"그리다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"연필이나 붓 등을 이용하여 사물을 선이나 색으로 나타내다.","englishExpression":"draw; paint","englishDescription":"To express an object in lines or colors by using a pencil, brush, etc.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57277&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:57277:3","headword":"그리다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"어떤 도형과 닮은 모양을 나타내다.","englishExpression":"draw","englishDescription":"To show a shape resembling a certain figure.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=57277&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:61195:2","headword":"빨아들이다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"(비유적으로) 다른 사람의 마음을 끌어당기다.","englishExpression":"draw","englishDescription":"(figurative) To attract someone's mind.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61195&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:61381:1","headword":"당기다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"무엇을 잡아 자기 쪽으로 가까이 오게 하다.","englishExpression":"pull; draw","englishDescription":"To grab something and bring it closer to oneself.","sourceUrl":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/eng/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61381&nation=eng&nationCode=6"},{"id":"krdict:62108:3","headword":"뽑아내다","partOfSpeech":"verb","partOfSpeechKo":"동사","definitionKo":"안에 든 기체나 액체를 밖으로 